correlation of \eqn{S} with the degree-only score \eqn{S^0 = -1/k} (centred
within components) and with degree, and the share of \eqn{\sum \Delta^2}
reproduced by \eqn{S_i - S_j} (\code{gradient_share}).  Report the degree share
with any directional analysis.

\strong{Relation to \code{graph_asymmetries()}.} For an edge stored as
\eqn{(u, v)}, \code{graph_asymmetries()} returns \code{w_away} \eqn{= w_{v|u}},
\code{w_to} \eqn{= w_{u|v}} and \code{delta = w_away - w_to}
